## Thought

Thoughts rise out of the pale blue sand that fills the bowl-shaped platforms floating off the dais in the void place where a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] is grown from a [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone]]. They are shaped like men, only a torso with arms and legs, featureless and transparent enough to show the void through them, and they burn in one of the keystone's two colors, orange or purple. They come up in numbers and fly at whoever is growing the heart. A thought that is killed scatters into smoke or simply goes out, and the energy of its death is drawn into the keystone.

## Fractured Ideal

A Fractured Ideal is a thought grown large and given magic. It has no true mouth, only a mouth-shaped hollow in its face, and it wears its own shroud of magical darkness, which thins when it is wounded. It changes color to match the light of the keystone. It breaks a person's courage with dread, and it burns them with a sickly green flame that clings to whatever it touches. Killed, it dissolves into a burst of star energy.
